    22→      maturity: draft
    23→      implementation: implemented
    24→    priority: high
    25→    tags:
    26→      - mvp
    27→      - core
    28→    description: |
    29→      A spec item is the fundamental unit in Kynetic Spec.
    30→      Everything - features, requirements, constraints, decisions,
    31→      tasks - is represented as an item with consistent structure.
    32→    acceptance_criteria:
    33→      - id: ac-item-1
    34→        given: any piece of spec content
    35→        when: it is stored in the spec
    36→        then: it exists as an item with id, title, type, and content
    37→      - id: ac-item-2
    38→        given: an item
    39→        when: it is created
    40→        then: it has a ULID assigned automatically
