    46→        type: requirement
    47→        status:
    48→          maturity: draft
    49→          implementation: verified
    50→        description: |
    51→          Every item MUST have:
    52→          - _ulid: Canonical unique identifier (auto-generated)
    53→          - title: Human-readable name (required, user-provided)
    54→
    55→          All other fields are optional with sensible defaults.
    56→        implements:
    57→          - '@spec-item'
