   309→    title: Reference System
   310→    type: feature
   311→    status:
   312→      maturity: draft
   313→      implementation: implemented
   314→    priority: high
   315→    tags:
   316→      - mvp
   317→      - core
   318→    description: |
   319→      The @reference syntax links items together. References can
   320→      point to slugs or ULIDs (full or shortened). The system
   321→      validates that all references resolve to existing items.
   322→    acceptance_criteria:
   323→      - id: ac-ref-1
   324→        given: an item with depends_on ["@auth-session"]
   325→        when: the spec is validated
   326→        then: the reference is checked against the slug index
   327→      - id: ac-ref-2
   328→        given: a reference "@01JHNK"
   329→        when: it's a unique ULID prefix
   330→        then: it resolves to the full ULID
   331→      - id: ac-ref-3
   332→        given: a reference to a non-existent item
   333→        when: validation runs
   334→        then: an error is reported with the broken reference
   335→    requirements:
   336→      - _ulid: 01JHNKA0W3REFS100000000000
   337→        slugs:
   338→          - ref-syntax
   339→        title: Reference Syntax
   340→        type: requirement
   341→        status:
   342→          maturity: draft
   343→          implementation: implemented
   344→        description: |
   345→          References use the @ prefix to distinguish from plain strings:
   346→
   347→          - "@slug-name" - Reference by slug
   348→          - "@01JHNK" - Reference by short ULID
   349→          - "@01KEZCJPHZ86X9PA509GREWDM0" - Reference by full ULID
   350→
   351→          References appear in relationship fields:
   352→          depends_on, implements, relates_to, tests, supersedes, blocked_by
   353→        implements:
   354→          - '@reference-system'
   355→      - _ulid: 01JHNKA0W4REFS200000000000
   356→        slugs:
   357→          - ref-validation
   358→        title: Reference Validation
   359→        type: requirement
   360→        status:
   361→          maturity: draft
   362→          implementation: implemented
   363→        description: |
   364→          All references MUST be validated:
   365→          1. Parse @ prefix to extract identifier
   366→          2. Attempt slug lookup, then ULID prefix lookup
   367→          3. Report errors for unresolved references
   368→          4. Report warnings for deprecated targets
   369→
   370→          Validation is triggered by `kspec validate --refs`
   371→        implements:
   372→          - '@reference-system'
